{"seq":3,"slug":"chargeback-claim-debit-note-governance","title":"质量索赔、扣款与 Debit Note 治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/supplier-performance-feedback/chargeback-claim-debit-note-governance","wordCount":2964,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"质量索赔-扣款与-debit-note-治理\">质量索赔、扣款与 Debit Note 治理</h1><p>一家做小家电的跨境卖家，2025 年从一家越南供应商进了一批 8 万台空气炸锅。IQC 抽检判定「电源线端子压接不良」为 major 缺陷，批次拒收；供应商答应返工，返工批次到货后又被判出同类缺陷。这时质量经理才发现一个尴尬的事实：过去三个月质量部门开了 11 份 SCAR，却没有一张索赔单进过财务系统，返工费、分选费、空运费全部由采购方自己吸收了。<strong>纠正措施解决「下次不再发生」，索赔与扣款解决「这次谁承担」</strong>——两件事在组织里经常被合成一句「跟供应商谈一下」，结果既不闭环也不可审计。这篇文档讲的是后者：如何把一次质量事件的成本，变成一份有法律基础、有证据链、可对账、可抵扣的应收/应付凭证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-索赔权-成本归集-单据三者必须分离\">核心概念：索赔权、成本归集、单据三者必须分离</h2><p>在跨境采购里，一张能真正收到的索赔必须同时成立三件事，缺任何一件都会在财务或法务环节被打回：</p>\n<p><strong>索赔权（claim right）</strong> 是法律与合同层面的资格——合同有没有约定质量违约的赔偿范围、通知时效、管辖与准据法。它由合同法、采购合同条款、以及（跨境时）CISG 这类公约决定。</p>\n<p><strong>成本归集（cost aggregation）</strong> 是会计层面的度量——这次事件产生了哪些可归因成本、每笔的成本动因是什么、哪些是直接成本、哪些是可预见的间接成本。</p>\n<p><strong>单据（document）</strong> 是凭证层面的载体——debit note（借项通知单）、credit note、发票调整，以及支撑它们的证据包。它由可审计的凭证规则与双边对账决定。</p>\n<p>三者分离的价值在于定位失效点：很多「索赔收不到」的真实原因不是供应商赖账，而是<strong>索赔权从未建立</strong>（合同没写）、或<strong>成本归集过度</strong>（把不可预见的间接损失也塞进去）、或<strong>单据不匹配</strong>（debit note 编号与供应商的应付账款系统对不上，被当作无效凭证搁置）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;质量事件关闭&lt;br/&gt;8D D5-D7 已验证&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;索赔权判定&lt;br/&gt;合同条款/时效/准据法&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;成本归集&lt;br/&gt;分选/返工/报废/运费/停线&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;证据包组装&lt;br/&gt;检验报告/照片/工时/发票&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;Debit Note 生成&lt;br/&gt;编号/金额/科目/税额&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;供应商确认?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|确认| G[&quot;AP 抵扣或独立收款&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|争议| H[&quot;分级争议处理&lt;br/&gt;证据补充/折让/仲裁&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;记分卡回写&lt;br/&gt;索赔率/回收率&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[\"质量事件关闭&lt;br/&gt;8D D5-D7 已验证\"] --&gt; B[\"索赔权判定&lt;br/&gt;合同条款/时效/准据法\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"成本归集&lt;br/&gt;分选/返工/报废/运费/停线\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"证据包组装&lt;br/&gt;检验报告/照片/工时/发票\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"Debit Note 生成&lt;br/&gt;编号/金额/科目/税额\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"供应商确认?\"}\n  F --&gt;|确认| G[\"AP 抵扣或独立收款\"]\n  F --&gt;|争议| H[\"分级争议处理&lt;br/&gt;证据补充/折让/仲裁\"]\n  H --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; I[\"记分卡回写&lt;br/&gt;索赔率/回收率\"]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"索赔权的法律基础-先看时效-再看可预见性\">索赔权的法律基础：先看时效，再看可预见性</h2><p>跨境质量索赔的第一个杀手不是金额，而是<strong>通知时效</strong>。联合国国际货物销售合同公约（CISG）第 38 条要求买方在货物到达后「不迟延地」检验，第 39 条要求不符合同的情形在「一段合理时间内」通知卖方，<strong>无论如何不得晚于收到货物起两年</strong>。这决定了索赔的物理时间窗：如果 IQC 在到货 45 天后才判定缺陷，且合同未约定更长的检验期，供应商完全可以主张通知不及时而拒赔——这不是道德问题，是条款问题。CISG 适用于营业地在不同缔约国的当事人之间的货物销售（中、美均为缔约国），除非双方明确排除。</p>\n<p>在英美法系下，美国统一商法典（UCC）给出两条基线。§ 2-714 规定买方接受货物后对违反担保的救济是**「接受时实际价值与担保价值之差额」**；§ 2-715 把可索赔项拆成两类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>附带损失（incidental damages）</strong>——检验费、收货与运输费、被正当拒收货物的保管费、为补货而支出的合理费用，以及「因迟延或其他违约而生的任何其他合理支出」。分选费、加急空运费通常落在这里。</li>\n<li><strong>间接损失（consequential damages）</strong>——（a）卖方在订约时有理由预见的、且<strong>无法通过补货或其他方式合理避免</strong>的经济损失（如停线损失、客户罚款）；（b）违反担保直接导致的人身或财产损害。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>「可预见性」与「能否合理避免」是两个硬门槛：供应商签合同时不知道你会因缺料停线，停线损失就可能不可索赔；你本可从现货市场补货却选择停线等待，损失也会被削减。所以合同里的<strong>赔偿范围约定</strong>（把分选费、返工工时、空运差价、客户罚款明确列为可索赔项并给出计算口径）比事后争论更有效——预先约定把不可预见的损失变成可预见的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法源</th>\n<th>关键条款</th>\n<th>对索赔治理的约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CISG</td>\n<td>第 38 条检验、第 39 条通知（≤2 年）</td>\n<td>决定通知时效窗口，逾期即失权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CISG</td>\n<td>第 35 条货物相符、第 74 条损害赔偿</td>\n<td>损害须为违约「可预见」的损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCC</td>\n<td>§ 2-714 接受后差价救济</td>\n<td>已收货批次的索赔基准是价值差额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCC</td>\n<td>§ 2-715 附带/间接损失</td>\n<td>附带损失宽，间接损失须可预见且不可避免</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISO 9001:2015</td>\n<td>§ 8.4 外部提供控制、§ 10.2 纠正措施</td>\n<td>索赔与 SCAR 须共享同一条不符合记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可索赔成本归集-拆成可举证的成本动因\">可索赔成本归集：拆成可举证的成本动因</h2><p>索赔金额不是拍脑袋的数字，而是若干可举证成本桶之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>claim</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>sort</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>scrap</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>freight</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>downtime</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>admin</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{claim}} = C_{\\text{sort}} + C_{\\text{rework}} + C_{\\text{scrap}} + C_{\\text{freight}} + C_{\\text{downtime}} + C_{\\text{admin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">claim</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sort</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scrap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">freight</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">downtime</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">admin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个桶都要有成本动因（cost driver）和证据源，否则在争议时会被逐条击穿。<strong>分选费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>sort</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{sort}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sort</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 由「需要 100% 全检的批」触发，动因是人工工时：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>sort</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>inspected</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>per piece</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>labor</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{sort}} = N_{\\text{inspected}} \\times t_{\\text{per piece}} \\times r_{\\text{labor}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sort</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inspected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per piece</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">labor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>返工费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>rework</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{rework}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rework</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 动因是返工工序的标准工时与实际材料补投；<strong>供应商自己执行的返工，费用不应计入索赔</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>报废损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>scrap</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{scrap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrap</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是价值归零的部分：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>scrap</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>bad</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mtext>material</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mtext>labor</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{scrap}} = N_{\\text{bad}} \\times (u_{\\text{material}} + u_{\\text{labor}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scrap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bad</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">material</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">labor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，材料单价取采购合同价而非售价。</p>\n<p><strong>运费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>freight</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{freight}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">freight</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 包含退货运费、补货加急运费（空运替代海运的差价）、延误导致的仓储滞期费；加急空运差价最容易被供应商认可，因为有运单可比价。</p>\n<p><strong>停线损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>downtime</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{downtime}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">downtime</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是最容易引发争议的一项，因为它是间接损失：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>downtime</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>stop</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>line</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{downtime}} = t_{\\text{stop}} \\times r_{\\text{line}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">downtime</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>line</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{line}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是产线单位时间的机会成本。它能否索赔取决于合同是否预先约定、以及买方是否已尽「合理避免」义务。</p>\n<p><strong>行政费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>admin</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{admin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">admin</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是按事件计的管理成本（检验、文档、差旅、第三方检测费），通常约定为固定金额或按索赔额百分比计算，避免逐笔举证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"debit-note-的单据工程-让凭证在对方的应付系统里可匹配\">Debit Note 的单据工程：让凭证在对方的应付系统里可匹配</h2><p><strong>Debit note（借项通知单，也称 debit memo）</strong> 是 B2B 交易中用于调整应付款的商业凭证：买方用它记录因退货、质量索赔、价格调整而应向供应商追偿的金额。它与 credit note 的区别在方向——debit note 是采购方向供应商<strong>主张</strong>，credit note 是供应商向采购方<strong>开立</strong>。跨境质量索赔里买方通常主张开 debit note，而供应商的财务系统若要合法入账，往往需要对方开出对应的 credit note——这一「单据方向错配」是实操中最大的摩擦点。</p>\n<p>把一份 debit note 做成「可被对方 AP 系统匹配」的凭证，需要满足四项匹配：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主体匹配。</strong> 收货主体、开票主体、付款主体必须是同一法人。跨境集团常见「香港采购主体收货、深圳工厂使用、开曼主体付款」，若索赔单收款主体与实际付款主体不一致，供应商的核销系统无法抵扣——主体映射要在合同签署时冻结。</li>\n<li><strong>编号匹配。</strong> debit note 必须引用双方可交叉定位的键：采购订单号（PO number）、发票号、批次号/SSCC、以及对应的不符合记录或 SCAR 编号。缺少交叉键的 debit note 会被搁置为无效抵扣。</li>\n<li><strong>科目与税额匹配。</strong> 质量赔偿在多数税收辖区属于<strong>价格调整</strong>而非独立收入，按独立服务收入开票会产生额外的增值税负担。索赔金额是含税前还是含税金额需在合同明确，避免双边重复计税。</li>\n<li><strong>证据包匹配。</strong> debit note 必须可追溯到证据包：IQC 检验报告（含抽样方案与判据，参照 ISO 2859-1 / GB/T 2828.1 的 AQL 结论）、缺陷照片、返工/分选工时记录、运费单、第三方检测报告。没有证据包的 debit note 在争议时等于一张白条。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"时效-争议与过账控制-三条容易失控的边界\">时效、争议与过账控制：三条容易失控的边界</h2><p><strong>付款时效与抵扣的先后顺序。</strong> 欧盟《迟付款指令》Directive 2011/7/EU 规定商业交易付款期为 60 天、公共机构为 30 天，逾期需支付利息与追偿成本（英国经 Late Payment of Commercial Debts Regulations 2013 落地，无约定付款日时以「收到发票或交付货物之较晚者起 30 天」为迟延起点）。这在质量索赔里有双向含义：买方若为等争议结论而拖着不付整张发票，可能反被供应商主张迟延利息；因此行业做法是<strong>先付无争议部分、单独挂账争议金额</strong>。押金额度通常设上限（如不超过该发票金额的 20%–30%），既保留抵扣杠杆，又不触发对方法务。</p>\n<p><strong>争议分级与升级。</strong> 争议不应只有一个「谈」的状态。可落为三级：证据补充（双方 15 个工作日内交换检测数据）、折让协商（按责任比例分摊，如供应商承担材料与返工、买方承担部分空运）、合同救济（扣款、暂停新订单、按违约金或仲裁执行）。每级都要有 owner、时限与书面结论，否则争议会永久滞留在「待沟通」。</p>\n<p><strong>过账控制与回收率度量。</strong> 索赔发出不等于收到。必须区分四个状态：<strong>已开单（issued）</strong>、<strong>已确认（acknowledged）</strong>、<strong>已抵扣/已收款（settled）</strong>、<strong>已核销坏账（written off）</strong>。回收率是这个闭环唯一的健康指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recovery Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>issued</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recovery Rate} = \\frac{\\sum C_{\\text{settled}}}{\\sum C_{\\text{issued}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recovery Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">issued</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平均回收天数则是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>DSO</mtext><mtext>claim</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>settle</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DSO}_{\\text{claim}} = \\frac{\\sum C_{\\text{settled}} \\times d_{\\text{settle}}}{\\sum C_{\\text{settled}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DSO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">claim</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>罚息若被追讨，公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>法定加点</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>365</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = P \\times (r_{\\text{ref}} + \\text{法定加点}) \\times \\frac{d}{365}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">法定加点</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">365</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该辖区的基准利率。这些数字必须回写到供应商记分卡——索赔率（claim rate）与回收率本身是绩效指标，与 <a href=\"supplier-quality-scorecard-ppm-fpy\">PPM 与记分卡</a> 的质量分并列；持续拒付质量索赔的供应商，即使 DPPM 达标，也应触发 <a href=\"supplier-tiering-avl-qualification\">分级下调</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>质量索赔治理的核心是把一次质量事件的三条线分开跑通：<strong>索赔权</strong>决定能不能要（时效、可预见性、合同约定），<strong>成本归集</strong>决定要多少（六个成本桶，每个都有动因与证据），<strong>单据</strong>决定能不能收到（主体、编号、科目、证据四项匹配）。三者的接口是 SCAR——<a href=\"../scar-8d-root-cause/capa-d5-d7-verification-escape\">8D 闭环的 D5–D7 验证</a> 完成后，索赔单才有资格引用已验证的纠正措施作为损害举证；<a href=\"../quality-incident-detection-triage/incoming-inspection-defect-classification\">缺陷分级与来料检验</a> 的判定结论，是分选费与报废损失的计算起点。成熟度的标志不是「每次都扣到钱」，而是每一笔扣款都能被供应商的应付系统匹配上、每一笔放弃都能说出法律或商务理由、并且这些结果稳定回写进供应商的绩效与分级决策。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质量索赔、扣款与 Debit Note 治理","id":"质量索赔-扣款与-debit-note-治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：索赔权、成本归集、单据三者必须分离","id":"核心概念-索赔权-成本归集-单据三者必须分离"},{"level":2,"text":"索赔权的法律基础：先看时效，再看可预见性","id":"索赔权的法律基础-先看时效-再看可预见性"},{"level":2,"text":"可索赔成本归集：拆成可举证的成本动因","id":"可索赔成本归集-拆成可举证的成本动因"},{"level":2,"text":"Debit Note 的单据工程：让凭证在对方的应付系统里可匹配","id":"debit-note-的单据工程-让凭证在对方的应付系统里可匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"时效、争议与过账控制：三条容易失控的边界","id":"时效-争议与过账控制-三条容易失控的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应商分级、AVL 准入与资格维持机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/supplier-performance-feedback/supplier-tiering-avl-qualification"},"next":{"title":"FMEA/PPAP/APQP 预防性质量工程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/systemic-prevention-data/fmea-ppap-apqp-prevention-model"}}